From 7cf1e2578b095eec83c3bc9247ea045112be32f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Jul 2023 18:51:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 319/954] feat(st-ddr): phy: release upgrade (firmware)

Upgrade PHY firmware part to A2022.11 release.
Construct also concatenated binaries using dd commands (ddr3 example):
    dd conv=noconv bs=1 if=ddr3_pmu_train_dmem.bin \
        of=ddr3_pmu_train.bin seek=0
    dd conv=noconv bs=1 if=ddr3_pmu_train_imem.bin \
        of=ddr3_pmu_train.bin seek=$((0x800))

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git ad234b930b94b2ff389b50d2b8e96f7fcf75cd4c feat(st-ddr): phy: release upgrade (firmware)]
Signed-off-by: Nicolas Le Bayon <nicolas.le.bayon@st.com>
Change-Id: I007b18d5697c75eea5b18fc4cdb16605c89c6995
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/323361
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
